\mathcal A)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为局部化</span>\n$$\r\n\\mathsf D(\\mathcal A) := \\mathsf {Ch}(\\mathcal A)[W^{-1}].\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $\\mathcal A$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/GrothendieckAbel范畴","text":"Grothendieck Abel <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的前提下</span>, $\\mathsf {D}(\\mathcal A)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/稳定∞-范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">稳定无穷范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n"}]}}}]}